 * The published command, and nothing else. `mdr` and `md-redline` in
 * package.json both point here, so this name cannot change; the implementation
 * moved to `cli.js` next door so it ends in an extension `tsconfig.bin.json`
 * can include. Extensionless, the largest file in the package was invisible to
